# Jenna Rae Cakes

> Cakes, desserts, macarons, and gifts from Winnipeg, delivered across Canada.

Jenna Rae Cakes specializes in custom cakes, one-of-a-kind creations, macarons, party platters, and baking classes. They combine artistry with high-quality ingredients to make celebrations memorable.

## Project Summary

> "At Jenna Rae Cakes, we bring sweetness and creativity together to craft beautiful desserts and treats for every occasion, from weddings and birthdays to corporate gifting and holidays."

## Homepage

- [Homepage](https://jennaraecakes.com/): Main entry point showcasing desserts, cakes, macarons, and gifts.

## Flagship Products & Services

- [Cakes](https://jennaraecakes.com/collections/cakes): Classic, custom, sheet, heart, macaron, and wedding cakes.
- [Desserts](https://jennaraecakes.com/collections/baked-goods): Brownies, cookie sandwiches, cupcakes, cookie dough cups, meringues, and snack cakes.
- [Macarons](https://jennaraecakes.com/collections/macaron-cakes): Individually packaged macarons and macaron cakes.
- [Party Platters](https://jennaraecakes.com/collections/party-platters): Assorted desserts for events and gatherings.
- [JRC Academy Classes](https://jennaraecakes.com/collections/classes/products/online-classes): Online baking workshops and courses.

## Specialty Collections

- [Weddings and Events](https://jennaraecakes.com/collections/wedding): Weddings, birthdays, new baby, corporate events, graduation, and gifting.
- [Dazzle Dust & Edible Products](https://jennaraecakes.com/collections/dazzle-dust): Edible glitter, lustre dust, liquid flavours, and baking accessories.
- [Cookbooks](https://jennaraecakes.com/collections/cookbooks): "Jenna Rae Cakes at Home" and "Jenna Rae Cakes and Sweet Treats."

